  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1037032/description_b4475579-d199-4fc0-9032-a91b4af9d863.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"719\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Create: Legacy Copper Continued</strong> 是一款简单的材质包，将所有原版铜块和物品调整为与 Create 模组的“经典铜”风格一致。非常适合希望将原版建筑与 Create 机械结合时保持视觉一致性的玩家。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcreate-legacy-copper-continued\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth 页面</a></p>\n<p>欢迎将其用于模组包中！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>目前支持的模组：</p>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends &amp; foes</a></p>",
